Solar System Simulation

@ydamitcodes shared a one-prompt solar system simulation built with Claude Fable 5. The result looked polished enough to feel close to a finished demo, and the code stayed clean.

https://t.co/NduTykPv2Q

@MyWestLord @uwunetes prompted Fable 5 once and it built "FABLE". 

A full story about itself, visuals, everything, no assets. 

Surprisingly deep and coherent. This one hits different because it's meta as hell and actually good. The self-awareness flex is real.
